--- !u!114 &852944418
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 852944415}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2f9eb3d1945ff1640a88058f7d4f2b42, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Neo.Rpg.Demo::Neo.Samples.ModuleDemoSceneInfo
  _moduleName: "Neo.Network \xB7 Mirror"
  _purpose: 'NeoNetworkManager runs Host, Client or Server. NetworkActionRelay carries
    NoCode events to every peer, RpgCharacterNetworkAdapter replicates the Shared
    Boss and NeoNetworkDiscovery finds LAN games. Every button is a saved UnityEvent:
    select it to see the call.'
  _runtimeApi: NeoNetworkManager.StartAsHost / StartAsClient(address) / StartAsServer
    / StopNetwork; NetworkActionRelay.TriggerByName / TriggerStringByName / TryGetChannelIndex
    + TriggerFloatAt; NeoNetworkDiscovery.StartDiscovery / QuickPlay / ConnectToFirstServer;
    RpgCharacterNetworkAdapter.NetDamage; NeoNetworkTelemetry.RttMs / BytesInPerSecond.
  _sceneWorkflow: '''Network Demo'': NeoNetworkManager + TelepathyTransport, lifecycle
    events log to the feed. ''[Demo] Network Objects/Shared Relay'': five channels
    and their listeners. ''[Demo] Network Objects/Shared Boss'': RpgCharacter + NetworkIdentity
    + RpgCharacterNetworkAdapter. ''[Demo] Services'': LAN Discovery and Network
    Telemetry.'
  _verification: 'Offline: Ping and Chat fire locally. Host: role ''Host'' and the
    boss wakes up. A second instance joins (Join or Quick Play): Ping reaches both
    peers, Wave only the other one, Hit changes the boss HP on both.'
  _showRuntimeOverlay: 1
  _corner: 0
  _accentColor: {r: 0.3, g: 0.78, b: 0.95, a: 1}
  _backgroundColor: {r: 0.11764706, g: 0.11764706, b: 0.15686275, a: 0.8509804}
  _panelWidth: 400
  _startCollapsed: 0
  _hints:
  - 'Second instance: a build, a Multiplayer Play Mode or ParrelSync clone; then
    Join (localhost)'
  - Relay channels are events (late joiners miss them); boss HP is replicated state
  - 'Hit and Revive use ServerOnly channels: clients never write HP'
  _overlayRoot: {fileID: 408721891}
  _titleLabel: {fileID: 1662304521}
  _descriptionLabel: {fileID: 1027919294}
  _hintsLabel: {fileID: 925357163}
  _collapseLabel: {fileID: 53144073}
  _collapsibleParts:
  - {fileID: 178779046}
  - {fileID: 703222691}
