--- !u!114 &925357163
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 925357161}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#4CC7F2>\xBB</color>  <b>Runtime API:</b> NeoNetworkManager.StartAsHost
    / StartAsClient(address) / StartAsServer / StopNetwork; NetworkActionRelay.TriggerByName
    / TriggerStringByName / TryGetChannelIndex + TriggerFloatAt; NeoNetworkDiscovery.StartDiscovery
    / QuickPlay / ConnectToFirstServer; RpgCharacterNetworkAdapter.NetDamage; NeoNetworkTelemetry.RttMs
    / BytesInPerSecond.\n<color=#4CC7F2>\xBB</color>  <b>Scene workflow:</b> 'Network
    Demo': NeoNetworkManager + TelepathyTransport, lifecycle events log to the feed.
    '[Demo] Network Objects/Shared Relay': five channels and their listeners. '[Demo]
    Network Objects/Shared Boss': RpgCharacter + NetworkIdentity + RpgCharacterNetworkAdapter.
    '[Demo] Services': LAN Discovery and Network Telemetry.\n<color=#4CC7F2>\xBB</color> 
    <b>Verification:</b> Offline: Ping and Chat fire locally. Host: role 'Host' and
    the boss wakes up. A second instance joins (Join or Quick Play): Ping reaches
    both peers, Wave only the other one, Hit changes the boss HP on both.\n<color=#4CC7F2>\xBB</color> 
    Second instance: a build, a Multiplayer Play Mode or ParrelSync clone; then Join
    (localhost)\n<color=#4CC7F2>\xBB</color>  Relay channels are events (late joiners
    miss them); boss HP is replicated state\n<color=#4CC7F2>\xBB</color>  Hit and
    Revive use ServerOnly channels: clients never write HP"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_fontSharedMaterials: []
  m_fontMaterial: {fileID: 0}
